r S&R": "easy imageSplitGrid"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [156], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [682.02490234375, 440.3219909667969], "pos": [-2532.32861328125, -181.52151489257812], "widgets_values": ["image1，Extract only the printed ink/design layer from the apparel photo and place it on a pure white rectangular canvas.\nThink of the input as two layers:\n1. ink/design layer: printed artwork that should remain\n2. garment/photo layer: cloth, shape, lighting, and texture that must disappear\nKeep the ink/design layer:\n- central body artwork\n- left and right sleeve prints when visible\n- left and right shoulder prints when visible\n- text, numbers, icons, badges, borders, stripes, bands, dots, line art, illustrations, decorative marks, and intentional distress attached to a design element\n- sleeve stripe bands, parallel sleeve lines, cuff-adjacent printed bands, and simple geometric sleeve marks; these are printed artwork and must not be mistaken for seams or sleeve edges\nDelete the garment/photo layer completely:\n- shirt silhouette, body outline, neckline, neck opening, collar, V-neck triangle, sleeve shapes, shoulder/yoke panels, side panels, hem, cuff, seams, stitching\n- fabric base color, mesh holes, knit/weave texture, cloth grain, folds, wrinkles, shadows, highlights, lighting gradients, background\n- large pink/white/gray/black/blue/colored cloth fields and any fabric panel used as a carrier behind the print\n- random dirt, loose splatter, ink wash, stains, mottled discoloration, and photo artifacts unless clearly attached to a printed design element\nOutput format requirements:\n- pure white background everywhere cloth was removed\n- no garment outline, no sewing-pattern pieces, no collar scrap, no shoulder panel shape, no sleeve panel shape\n- print zones may be separated by white space, but their original left/right/up/down relationship should remain recognizable\n- front views usually contain five visible zones: center body, left sleeve, right sleeve, left shoulder, right shoulder; keep all visible zones\n- a sleeve zone may include both a large number/icon and one or more horizontal printed stripes or word bands; keep both\nDo not create or redraw a new design. Do not rewrite text. Do not recolor, vectorize, simplify, or merge everything into one emblem. Preserve the source artwork's visible colors, outlines, relative scale, rotation, and placement. The result is wrong if it looks like a shirt, a flat garment pattern, or only the central body graphic."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 113, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [162, 165, 166], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "INT"}], "color": "#56756c", "widgets_values": [2048], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "Value"}, "name": "Value", "label": "Value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "Value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "DF_Integer", "title": "分块尺寸", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#426158", "size": [300, 90], "pos": [1407.7503662109375, -50.56624984741211], "id": 120, "properties": {"cnr_id": "derfuu_comfyui_moddednodes", "ver": "d0905bed31249f2bd0814c67585cf4fe3c77c015", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DF_Integer"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2780.89306640625, 131.9292755126953], "widgets_values": ["画布比例 4:5，隐形 3×3 均分网格，无分格线条，9 个画格长宽完全相同，纯白底色；1-8 格只保留服装原始油墨印花，剔除全部衣料、衣身、衣服底色、肩袖基底，印花不改色、不重绘、不简化，不加序号水印。\n硬性尺寸规则：所有印花统一缩放至单个格子内部面积的 1/2 大小，图案不越出格子、完整不裁切，全部印花尺寸统一。\n上排横向三格：\n左上 1 格：图 1 正面主印花，1/2 尺寸，紧贴格子左上角；\n中上 2 格：图 1 左肩印花，1/2 尺寸，紧贴格子顶部居中；\n右上 3 格：图 1 右肩印花，1/2 尺寸，紧贴格子右上角；\n左中 4 格：图 1 左袖印花，1/2 尺寸，格内居中；\n正中 5 格：图 1 右袖印花，1/2 尺寸，格内居中；\n右中 6 格：图 2 背面全套主印花，1/2 尺寸，紧贴格子右侧；\n左下 7 格：图 2 左袖印花，1/2 尺寸，格内居中；\n中下 8 格：图 2 右袖印花，1/2 尺寸，格内居中；\n右下 9 格：纯白空白，无任何图案。\n强制要求：9 格大小完全一致，印花均为单格一半尺寸，无布料衣物残留。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 85, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [270, 270], "pos": [-1027.6820068359375, -1026.92041015625], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 159, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 115, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [150, 159, 189], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["帮我把这张图转为儿童插画风格，色彩鲜艳", "1:1", false, 359134049, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 104, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAG